inding—running instances repeatedly while praying to the RNG gods for rare drops. That’s the main attraction of the game. So if grinding is not your thing, give this a pass.", "timestamp_created": 1718473628, "timestamp_updated": 1718473628, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523025095462799072", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "167425379", "author": {"steamid": "76561198146078246", "personaname": "Oatboy13", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/oatboy03/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 4037, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3780, "last_played": 1739855621, "avatar": "0610f73b3238df6cb2ca33ec9a7e14d1ff9eeb2d"}, "language": "english", "review": "darksouls with guns", "timestamp_created": 1718464957, "timestamp_updated": 1718464957, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.478142082691192627", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167396631", "author": {"steamid": "76561199029866060", "personaname": "ViableClutch", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199029866060/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 1095, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 889, "last_played": 1777619003, "avatar": "b6476664201860803127f1fea0c92a5449435b15"}, "language": "english", "review": "sleepy is sus should probably ban him", "timestamp_created": 1718434093, "timestamp_updated": 1718434093, "voted_up": true, "votes_up":